ating how much of that money she used to buy the dolls.\n\n- Each doll costs $1, and she bought 3 dolls.\n- Total spent on dolls: $ 3 \\times 1 = \\$3 $\n\nNow, subtract the amount spent on the dolls from the total amount she received:\n\n$$\n\\$100 - \\$3 = \\boxed{97}\n$$\n\nAmy has $\\boxed{97}$ dollars left.<|im_end|>", "source_record": {"question": "Amy's grandfather gave her $100 for her birthday. Amy bought 3 dolls, each of which cost $1. How much money does Amy have left?", "answer": "The cost of the dolls is 3 × $1 = $<<3*1=3>>3.\nAmy has $100 − $3 = $97 left.\n#### 97", "prompt": "Solve the following grade-school math problem. Show your reasoning and put the final answer in \\boxed{}.\n\nProblem: Amy's grandfather gave her $100 for her birthday. Amy bought 3 dolls, each of which cost $1. How much money does Amy have left?\nSolution:", "solutions": ["97"], "solution": "97"}, "prompt_tokens": [151644, 872, 198, 50, 3948, 279, 2701, 11972, 34689, 6888, 3491, 13, 6928, 697, 32711, 323, 2182, 279, 1590, 4226, 304, 1124, 79075, 6257, 382, 31198, 25, 28693, 594, 37850, 6551, 1059, 400, 16, 15, 15, 369, 1059, 15198, 13, 28693, 10788, 220, 18, 63781, 11, 1817, 315, 892, 2783, 400, 16, 13, 2585, 1753, 3220, 1558, 28693, 614, 2115, 5267, 36842, 25, 151645], "response_tokens": [151667, 198, 32313, 11, 1077, 594, 1490, 13, 2055, 11, 28693, 594, 37850, 6551, 1059, 400, 16, 15, 15, 369, 1059, 15198, 13, 5005, 28693, 10788, 220, 18, 63781, 11, 1817, 53724, 400, 16, 13, 576, 3405, 374, 11, 1246, 1753, 3220, 1558, 1340, 614, 2115, 1939, 80022, 11, 1077, 752, 1438, 419, 1495, 13, 5512, 11, 279, 2790, 3311, 2661, 311, 1059, 374]}
